etter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><b>1. <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">10</span></b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">11</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">일 이후에는 기존 웹메일로 이메일 수발신이 불가</span></b>합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><b>2.  </b></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">신규 전환하는 국내 클라우드 시스템에도 가입이 불가함</span>을 사전에 알려드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><b>3.  </b></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">기존 웹메일는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">일 종료될 예정이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">, <b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">10</span></b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">11</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">14</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">시 이후에 기존 웹메일은 수발신이 되지 않습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><b>4.  </b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">중요한 이메일은 미리 백업하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><b>5.  <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">10</span></b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">11</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">일 이전에 미리 교내 메일 주소를 수신주소로 지정한 모든 사이트에 접속하여 수신주소를 다른 메일주소로 변경해 주셔야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;그렇지 않으면 메일 수신에 문제가 발생할 수 있으므로 꼭 조치하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">예시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">카드결제내역을 메일로 수신 서비스를 이용하시는 경우 해당 사이트로 가셔서 기존 수신주소를 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">(**@kumoh.ac.kr)-&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">다른 메일주소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">(***@naver.com </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">로 변경</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><b>6.  </b></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">기존 웹메일은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">@oldmail.kumoh.ac.kr</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">을 통하여 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">31</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">일까지 유지할 예정입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 116, 28);\">졸업자 및 퇴직자도 소중한 가족이기에 전산 서비스를 제공하고 싶은 마음은 가득하지만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 116, 28);\">, </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 116, 28);\">우리 대학의 한정된 예산이 투입되는 서비스로서 재학 및 재직 중인 구성원에게 먼저 서비스를 제공하고자 하오니 많은 양해 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 116, 28);\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 116, 28);\">차후 대학에서 충분한 예산이 확보된다면 많은 구성원을 대상으로 서비스를 확대하겠습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 116, 28);\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 116, 28);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 116, 28);\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 116, 28);\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 116, 28);\">졸업자 및 퇴직자 등의 경우에 발전기금납부 등에 따른 예우로 국내 클라우드 시스템에 계정을 제공할 예정임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 116, 28);\">).</span> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">감사합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"background-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">.</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">25</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">일 정보전산원</span></p></div><p style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span sty